ine_Tiers are enforced at the gateway and credential level, not merely in prompts: an agent without_newline_outbound permissions does not possess the credentials or network routes to act outbound,_newline_regardless of what it is told or tricked into attempting. The conscience agent_apostrophe_s permission-pause_newline_action operates by changing an agent_apostrophe_s tier in the live configuration, which gateways respect_newline_immediately._newline__newline_2.7 Evaluation loop_newline_Hive performance is evaluated on two independent tracks. Quantitative metrics (token spend_newline_per agent, tasks completed, blocked, and aged, bus volume, escalation counts) are computed_newline_by deterministic scripts run on a schedule, with no agent judgment in the numbers. Qualitative_newline_assessment is owned by the conscience agent, which reads the metrics plus the raw bus and_newline_drafts a periodic retrospective for human review. The Chief of Staff separately reports what got_newline_done; disagreement between the two views is itself treated as useful signal._newline__newline_2.8 Fleet management and recovery_newline_All agents of a given type are built from a single shared container image, with guiding prompts_newline_and credentials injected as configuration, so upgrading the whole fleet is a rebuild plus a_newline_one-command redeploy. Guiding prompts, the constitution, promotion rules, and the permissions_newline_file are version-controlled together. A human-only, out-of-band recovery path (plain SSH with no_newline_agent in the loop) is maintained at all times, so that no failure of the self-managing_newline_infrastructure, including the sys-admin agent itself, can lock humans out._newline__newline_3. Initial Agent Roster_newline_The initial hive consists of 5 OmegaClaw agents and 10 OpenClaw agents. This roster is a_newline_starting point: the architecture above does not depend on it, and the roster is expected to evolve_newline_as part of the research._newline_