t become a bottleneck. If it's doing deep analysis of every inter-agent exchange, it'll consume more tokens than the work it's monitoring. The liveness-check version (stall detection, abandonment-ratio tracking) is cheap. The deep meta-cognitive version is expensive and probably should be sampled periodically rather than continuously.")) 
